### GET Reliance Stock Price
GET http://localhost:8000/api/price/RELIANCE

### GET TCS Stock Price
GET http://localhost:8000/api/price/TCS

### GET Bitcoin Price
GET http://localhost:8000/api/price/BTCUSDT

### GET Ethereum Price
GET http://localhost:8000/api/price/ETHUSDT

### Place BUY order for Reliance
POST http://localhost:8000/api/order/buy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "RELIANCE",
  "quantity": 1
}

### Place SELL order for Reliance
POST http://localhost:8000/api/order/sell
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "RELIANCE",
  "quantity": 1
}

### Place BUY order for Bitcoin
POST http://localhost:8000/api/order/buy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "BTCUSDT",
  "quantity": 0.001
}

### Get Health Status
GET http://localhost:8000/api/health

### Get Supported Stocks
GET http://localhost:8000/api/supported-stocks
